[id chapter1.start]
*start
[id chapter1.route]
[set routeName=choice]
[id chapter1.choice.stay]
[choice text="留在月台" goto=stay]
[id chapter1.choice.leave]
[choice text="前往燈塔" goto=leave]
[choice.wait]
[id chapter1.stay]
*stay
[id chapter1.unlock-variable]
[set endingUnlocked=true]
[id chapter1.unlock-gallery]
[commercial.unlock id=ending-cg]
[id chapter1.stay-ending]
我們等到了第一班電車。
[id chapter1.stay-end]
[end]
[id chapter1.leave]
*leave
[id chapter1.leave-ending]
她轉身走向海邊的燈塔。
[id chapter1.leave-end]
[end]
